# A token that is a copy has as its copiable values the values it copied (CR 707.2, 111.1), and being a token is not one
# of them. On turn 1 Bot1 casts Ornithopter, then Three Steps Ahead's copy mode for a token Ornithopter, then Clone,
# choosing the token from the two Ornithoppers: the Clone is an Ornithopter (a 0/2 artifact Thopter with flying) and a
# card, not a token, and nothing of Clone's own is left.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Black Lotus
Black Lotus
Mox Sapphire
Ornithopter
Three Steps Ahead
Clone
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x15

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Three Steps Ahead.Cast
Bot1.Modes(2)
Bot1.Target(Ornithopter)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter#2.Token = true
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Clone.Cast
Bot1.Accept
Bot1.Target(Ornithopter#2)
[Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Turn = 1
Stack.Count = 0
Bot1.Battlefield = Island; Mox Sapphire; Ornithopter; Ornithopter; Ornithopter
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter#2.Token = true
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter#3.Token = (absent)
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter#3.Types = Artifact; Creature
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter#3.Subtypes = Thopter
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter#3.Toughness = 2
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter#3.Keywords = Flying
Bot1.Graveyard = Black Lotus; Three Steps Ahead; Black Lotus
